  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 864f32d36e36a5644aa8fbd495f2626a, type: 3}
  m_Name: mayor 3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  line: Really? Questions like this in my time of need? If you must know, Those peasants
    kept badgering me. Telling me what I should do with my money. "We want this,
    we want that, we want you to reinforce the dam." Blah blah blah, I couldn't stand
    it. So I left. Don't get me started on the Damton peasants. They are obsessed
    with the strenghth of that dam! Even though it has stood for generations!
  option1:
    text: Goodbye.
